[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19982.788, "timestamp": "05:33:02", "text": "或者其他什么东西，这样我就可以把它填进去。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19986.31, "timestamp": "05:33:06", "text": "太平淡了，对吧？我的意思是，我可以放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19996.15, "timestamp": "05:33:16", "text": "O 只是我的 Pi 快要死了。等等，我能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19999.51, "timestamp": "05:33:19", "text": "暂停？哦，我可以暂停。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20002.27, "timestamp": "05:33:22", "text": "作品。不一定非得如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20004.19, "timestamp": "05:33:24", "text": "移动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20006.788, "timestamp": "05:33:26", "text": "哦，我觉得每个人都需要他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20009.03, "timestamp": "05:33:29", "text": "隐私，尤其是名人的隐私。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20011.51, "timestamp": "05:33:31", "text": "当然。当然。有些人会跟踪别人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20013.99, "timestamp": "05:33:33", "text": "呃，他们的偶像，这不对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20018.548, "timestamp": "05:33:38", "text": "真的。是真的。是真的。对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20021.51, "timestamp": "05:33:41", "text": "属实。这就是事实。人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20023.548, "timestamp": "05:33:43", "text": "照做就是了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20028.43, "timestamp": "05:33:48", "text": "一切。与此同时，我对此表示支持。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20031.51, "timestamp": "05:33:51", "text": "对话。认识我的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20035.03, "timestamp": "05:33:55", "text": "我知道，呃，我有点推广……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20038.548, "timestamp": "05:33:58", "text": "跟踪。不是那种不好的感觉。好的。"}]